# WeChat ad insertion test rules
# Scope: Fusion conservative WeChat ad layer. Keep it narrow until manual testing confirms no impact on images, mini programs, login, payment, and media upload.
# Do not add qpic.cn, gtimg.cn, wx.qq.com, weixin.qq.com, servicewechat.com, wxapp.tc.qq.com, or wechatpay.cn here.

# Tencent advertising / Guangdiantong
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gdt.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,l.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,e.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pgdt.gtimg.cn,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mi.gdt.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ii.gdt.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,win.gdt.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,v.gdt.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,c.gdt.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,m.gdt.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adsmind.gdtimg.com,REJECT,pre-matching

