DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ad.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adsfile.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adfilter.imtt.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adping.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
