DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adshmct.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adslvfile.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adslvseed.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adsmind.apdcdn.tc.qq.com,REJECT,pre-matching
