# Explicitly documented exclusions for safety:
# - WeChat media: qpic.cn, gtimg.cn, qlogo.cn, wx.qq.com, wxapp.tc.qq.com
# - WeChat account/payment/service: weixin.qq.com, servicewechat.com, wechatpay.cn
# - Mini program resources: servicewechat.com, wxapp.tc.qq.com
